  m_text: "<b>Presented by</b>\r\nThe Video Game Development Club @ UC San Diego\r\n\r\n<b>Director</b>\r\nEthan
    Schwartzman\r\n\r\n<b>Producer</b>\r\nIsabel Hsieh\r\n\r\n<b>Creative Director</b>\r\nEric
    Cai\r\n\r\n<b>Original Story Concept</b>\r\nEric Cai\r\n\r\n<b>Writing Lead</b>\r\nJess
    Yang\r\n\r\n<b>Writing Team</b>\r\nBenjamin Mintz\r\nDzaiddin bin Mohd Khazani\r\nGrace
    Yu\r\nJason Xu\r\nJorge Lozoya\r\nLeandra Fotsing\r\nLucas Ramirez\r\nLuke Walters\r\nSamantha
    Iwashita\r\n\r\n<b>Design Lead</b>\r\nEthan Carter\r\n\r\n<b>Design Team</b>\r\nAbdurrahman
